Normalized DAC81416 REFCMP RC sensitivity model
* Rint=1e+06 ohm is swept because TI does not publish the internal value.
* This is not a reference-loop stability model.
.options reltol=1e-8 abstol=1e-13 vntol=1e-10 plotwinsize=0
Vdrive src 0 PULSE(0 1 1u 1n 1n 0.00528 0.01056)
Rint src refcmp 1e+06
Ccomp refcmp 0 3.3e-10
.tran 6.6e-07 0.00264
.save time v(refcmp)
.end
